<% content_for :title, "Commercial Truck Services | Trucks of Nevada" %>
<% set_meta_tags title: "Commercial Truck Services", description: "We provide professional commercial truck system repairs in Las Vegas, NV." %>

<section class="emergency-banner">
  <div class="banner-content">
    <p>NEED EMERGENCY ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE NOW?</p>
    <a href="tel:+17023332463" class="call-button phone-number">CLICK TO CALL</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="truck-services">
  <div class="services-header">
    <h1>Commercial Truck Services</h1>
    <div class="underline"></div>
    <p>
      We can cover all your needs for your semi truck. <br />
      From regular maintenance like oil & lube services, to engine and suspension repairs or adjustments.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="services-cards">
      <div class="service-card">
        <%= link_to diagnostic_path do %>
          <%= ik_image_tag("Trucks/services1.jpg", 
        transformation: [
          { width: 400, height: 300, crop: "at_max", quality: 80 }
        ], 
        loading: "lazy", 
        alt: "Diagnostics & Inspection") 
    %>
          <div class="service-card-content">
            <h3>Diagnostics & Inspection</h3>
            <span class="card-link">></span>
            </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>

    <div class="service-card">
      <%= link_to aftertreatment_path do %>
        <%= ik_image_tag("Trucks/services2.jpg", 
        transformation: [
          { width: 400, height: 300, crop: "at_max", quality: 80 }
        ], 
        loading: "lazy", 
        alt: "Aftertreatment") 
    %>
        <div class="service-card-content">
          <h3>Aftertreatment</h3>
          <span class="card-link">></span>
          </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <%= link_to maintenance_path do %>
        <%= ik_image_tag("Trucks/services3.jpg", 
        transformation: [
          { width: 400, height: 300, crop: "at_max", quality: 80 }
        ], 
        loading: "lazy", 
        alt: "Oil Change & Maintenance") 
    %>
        <div class="service-card-content">
          <h3>Oil Change & Maintenance</h3>
          <span class="card-link">></span>
          </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trailer-repairs">
  <div class="repairs-header">
    <h2>TRAILER REPAIRS</h2>
    <div class="underline"></div>
    <p>Dry Van, Reefer, Flat Bed or Step Deck<br />Service your trailer with <strong>Trucks of Nevada</strong></p>
  </div>

  <div class="repairs-content">
    <div class="repair-item">
      <div class="repair-icon">
        <!-- Icon: Shield -->
        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
      </div>
      <h3>ANNUAL INSPECTION</h3>
      <p>Stay in compliance with the DOT with tractor and trailer annual inspection. Most inspections are performed in less than an hour.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="repair-item">
      <div class="repair-icon">
        <!-- Icon: Exclamation -->
        <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i>
      </div>
      <h3>BRAKE DRUMS AND PADS</h3>
      <p>One of the most important parts on your trailer, are the brakes. Good brakes will greatly impact your stopping distance and risks of jackknife.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="repair-item">
      <div class="repair-icon">
        <!-- Icon: Truck -->
        <i class="fas fa-truck"></i>
      </div>
      <h3>SUSPENSION REPAIR</h3>
      <p>Bad suspension on your trailer will increase instability on the road, cause tire damage, and increase the risk of accidents.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="repair-item">
      <div class="repair-icon">
        <!-- Icon: Gauge -->
        <i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt"></i>
      </div>
      <h3>AIR & ELECTRICAL LINES</h3>
      <p>Air Leaks and Electrical issues are the most usual problems on trailers, but they still pose a safety risk for truck drivers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
